# Keep LF line endings in the working tree on every platform. Prettier, ESLint, and the exact
# bytes of the Markdown fixtures depend on it, and Windows checkouts must not convert them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.vsix binary
*.png binary

# The CRLF sample page keeps its Windows line endings byte for byte.
samples/demo/docs/special/crlf.md -text
